From 5103c6f608d73b35bed882bc99f3673754c6da68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kernel <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:17:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6225: include rpm-icc tag macros

The CAMSS interconnect paths (0056) use RPM_ACTIVE_TAG /
RPM_ALWAYS_TAG, defined in dt-bindings/interconnect/
qcom,rpm-icc.h, which sm6225.dtsi never included. CPP left
the unknown identifiers in place and dtc failed lexically
on the barewords. Add the include. This only surfaced once
the preceding C build failures were fixed and the workflow
reached the dtbs step.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225.dtsi | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225.dtsi
index fbda0a23b115..e3803c1469d1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225.dtsi
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@
 #include <dt-bindings/clock/qcom,gpucc-khaje.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/clock/qcom,rpmcc.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/interconnect/qcom,bengal.h>
+#include <dt-bindings/interconnect/qcom,rpm-icc.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/interrupt-controller/arm-gic.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/power/qcom-rpmpd.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/regulator/qcom,rpm-smd-regulator.h>
-- 
2.39.5

